+- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/events/compaction.rs` — compactor, scheduler, retention rotation, bootstrap loader, typed errors.
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/events/snapshot_tests.rs` — snapshot, compaction, bootstrap, scheduler tests.
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/events/mod.rs` — exports for snapshot and compaction modules.
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/events/store.rs` — latest cursor, guarded truncation, post-cursor reads, compaction event counts.
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/events/schema.sql` and `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/events/migrations.rs` — compaction-control table and delete-trigger bypass migration.
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/graph/model.rs`, `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/memory/model.rs`, `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/memory/mod.rs` — snapshot comparison/export support.
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/main.rs` — daemon-managed background compaction scheduler wiring.
+- `daemon/Cargo.toml`, `daemon/crates/lattice-core/Cargo.toml`, `daemon/Cargo.lock` — CBOR dependency wiring using already cached lockfile packages.
+- `docs/architecture/2026-05-16-event-log-compaction.md` — snapshot format, schedule, bootstrap, recovery, retention, observability.
+
